@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Refund Policy";
}

<div class="policy-shell">
    <!-- Hero / Banner -->
    <section class="policy-hero">
        <div class="policy-hero-inner">
            <p class="policy-badge">Orders & Returns</p>
            <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
            <p class="policy-subtitle">
                How refunds, returns, and exchanges are handled by <strong>NURAHERBEX PRIVATE LIMITED</strong>.
            </p>
            <p class="policy-meta">Last updated: <strong>November 18, 2025</strong></p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Content Layout -->
    <section class="policy-body">
        <!-- TOC -->
        <aside class="policy-toc">
            <div class="policy-toc-card">
                <p class="policy-toc-title">On this page</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#refund-overview">Overview</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#refund-window">Return Window & Eligibility</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#refund-start">How to Start a Return</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#refund-damages">Damages & Issues</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#refund-exceptions">Exceptions / Non-Returnable Items</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#refund-exchanges">Exchanges</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#refund-eu">EU 14-Day Cooling-Off Period</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#refund-process">Refunds</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#refund-contact">Contact for Returns</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <article class="policy-content rte">
            <h2 id="refund-overview">Overview</h2>
            <p>
                At <strong>NURAHERBEX PRIVATE LIMITED</strong> (“we”, “us”, “our”), we want you to be satisfied with your
                purchase. This Refund Policy explains how returns, exchanges, and refunds are handled for orders placed
                through our website.
            </p>

            <h2 id="refund-window">Return Window & Eligibility</h2>
            <p>
                We have a <strong>3-day return policy</strong>, which means you have 3 days after receiving your item to
                request a return.
            </p>
            <p>To be eligible for a return:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Your item must be in the <strong>same condition</strong> that you received it.</li>
                <li>It must be <strong>unworn or unused</strong>, with all tags attached.</li>
                <li>It must be in its <strong>original packaging</strong>.</li>
                <li>You will need the <strong>receipt or proof of purchase</strong>.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 id="refund-start">How to Start a Return</h2>
            <p>
                To start a return, please contact us at
                <!-- Replace with your returns/support email, e.g. support@nuraherbex.com -->
                <strong>your-email@nuraherbex.com</strong>.
            </p>
            <p>
                Returns will need to be sent to the following address, unless otherwise instructed by our support team:
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong>NURAHERBEX PRIVATE LIMITED</strong><br />
                27A, MARUTHI NAGAR, NEHRU ST, OIL MILLS RD, THUNDALAM<br />
                Porur, Kanchipuram, Sriperumbudur<br />
                Tamil Nadu – 600116, India
            </p>
            <p>
                If your return is accepted, we’ll send you:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>A <strong>return shipping label</strong>, where applicable.</li>
                <li><strong>Instructions</strong> on how and where to send your package.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                Items sent back to us <strong>without first requesting a return</strong> will not be accepted.
            </p>
            <p>
                You can always contact us for any return-related question at
                <strong>your-email@nuraherbex.com</strong>.
            </p>

            <h2 id="refund-damages">Damages and Issues</h2>
            <p>
                Please inspect your order upon reception and contact us immediately if:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>The item is <strong>defective</strong> or <strong>damaged</strong>, or</li>
                <li>You receive the <strong>wrong item</strong>,</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                so that we can evaluate the issue and make it right as quickly as possible.
            </p>

            <h2 id="refund-exceptions">Exceptions / Non-Returnable Items</h2>
            <p>
                Certain types of items cannot be returned, including (but not limited to):
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Perishable goods</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Custom or personalized products</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Personal care goods</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Hazardous materials, flammable liquids, or gases</strong></li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                Please get in touch if you have questions or concerns about your specific item before purchasing or
                initiating a return.
            </p>
            <p>
                Unfortunately, we <strong>cannot accept returns</strong> on <strong>sale items</strong> or
                <strong>gift cards</strong>.
            </p>

            <h2 id="refund-exchanges">Exchanges</h2>
            <p>
                The fastest way to ensure you get what you want is to:
            </p>
            <ol>
                <li><strong>Return the item</strong> you have, following the process above; and then</li>
                <li>
                    Once the return is accepted, <strong>make a separate purchase</strong> for the new item you want.
                </li>
            </ol>

            <h2 id="refund-eu">European Union – 14 Day Cooling-Off Period</h2>
            <p>
                Notwithstanding the above, if the merchandise is being shipped into the European Union, you have the right
                to <strong>cancel or return your order within 14 days</strong>, for any reason and without a justification.
            </p>
            <p>
                As above, your item must be in the same condition that you received it, unworn or unused, with tags, and in
                its original packaging. You’ll also need the receipt or proof of purchase.
            </p>

            <h2 id="refund-process">Refunds</h2>
            <p>
                We will notify you once we’ve received and inspected your return, and let you know if the refund was
                <strong>approved</strong> or <strong>rejected</strong>.
            </p>
            <p>
                If approved, you’ll be automatically refunded on your original payment method within
                <strong>10 business days</strong>.
            </p>
            <p>
                Please remember it can take some time for your bank or credit card company to process and post the refund
                too.
            </p>
            <p>
                If <strong>more than 15 business days</strong> have passed since we approved your return and you have not
                received your refund, please contact us at <strong>your-email@nuraherbex.com</strong>.
            </p>

            <h2 id="refund-contact">Contact for Returns & Refunds</h2>
            <p>
                For any questions regarding returns, exchanges, or refunds, you can reach us at:
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong>NURAHERBEX PRIVATE LIMITED</strong><br />
                27A, MARUTHI NAGAR, NEHRU ST, OIL MILLS RD, THUNDALAM<br />
                Porur, Kanchipuram, Sriperumbudur<br />
                Tamil Nadu – 600116, India<br />
                Email: <strong>your-email@nuraherbex.com</strong> <!-- replace with real email --><br />
                Phone: <!-- your official phone number -->
            </p>
        </article>
    </section>
</div>

<style>
    :root {
        --policy-accent: #0f766e; /* Change this to your brand primary color */
        --policy-accent-soft: rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.08);
        --policy-bg: #0b1120;
    }

    .policy-shell {
        background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.12), transparent 55%), radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12), transparent 55%), #0b1120;
        padding-bottom: 64px;
        color: #0f172a;
    }

    .policy-hero {
        padding: 64px 16px 40px;
        text-align: center;
        color: #f9fafb;
    }

    .policy-hero-inner {
        max-width: 880px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .policy-badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        padding: 4px 10px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.5);
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        color: #e5e7eb;
    }

    .policy-hero h1 {
        font-size: 2.4rem;
        line-height: 1.15;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .policy-subtitle {
        font-size: 1rem;
        max-width: 560px;
        margin: 0 auto 12px;
        color: #cbd5f5;
    }

    .policy-meta {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #9ca3af;
    }

    .policy-body {
        max-width: 1120px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 16px;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 280px minmax(0, 1fr);
        gap: 32px;
        align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .policy-toc {
        position: sticky;
        top: 96px;
        align-self: flex-start;
        display: none;
    }

    .policy-toc-card {
        background: #020617;
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 18px 18px 14px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35);
        box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.45);
        color: #e5e7eb;
    }

    .policy-toc-title {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        color: #9ca3af;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .policy-toc ul {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .policy-toc li + li {
        margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .policy-toc a {
        display: block;
        padding: 6px 8px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #e5e7eb;
        transition: background 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease, transform 0.12s ease;
        font-weight: 400;
    }

        .policy-toc a:hover {
            background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.22);
            color: #f9fafb;
            transform: translateX(2px);
        }

    .policy-content {
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 32px 28px;
        box-shadow: 0 22px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.25), 0 0 0 1px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #111827;
    }

        .policy-content > p:first-of-type {
            font-size: 1.02rem;
            color: #374151;
        }

        .policy-content h2 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 650;
            margin-top: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
            scroll-margin-top: 96px;
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 10px;
        }

            .policy-content h2::before {
                content: "";
                position: absolute;
                left: 0;
                top: 6px;
                bottom: 6px;
                width: 3px;
                border-radius: 999px;
                background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--policy-accent), #22c55e);
                opacity: 0.8;
            }

        .policy-content h3 {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 1.6rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .policy-content p {
            margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
            color: #4b5563;
        }

        .policy-content ul {
            margin: 0 0 1rem 1.3rem;
            padding: 0;
            color: #4b5563;
        }

        .policy-content ol {
            margin: 0 0 1rem 1.3rem;
            padding: 0;
            color: #4b5563;
        }

        .policy-content li {
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        }

        .policy-content strong {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #111827;
        }

        .policy-content a {
            color: var(--policy-accent);
            text-decoration: none;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
            transition: color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
        }

            .policy-content a:hover {
                color: #059669;
                border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.6);
            }

        .policy-content h2:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.06), transparent);
        }

    @@media (min-width: 992px) {
        .policy-toc {
            display: block;
        }

        .policy-hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
        }
    }

    @@media (max-width: 991.98px) {
        .policy-body {
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
            padding-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .policy-content {
            padding: 24px 18px;
            border-radius: 16px;
        }

        .policy-shell {
            padding-bottom: 40px;
        }
    }

    @@media (max-width: 640px) {
        .policy-hero {
            padding: 42px 14px 28px;
        }

            .policy-hero h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

        .policy-subtitle {
            font-size: 0.94rem;
        }

        .policy-content {
            font-size: 0.96rem;
        }
    }
</style>
